  <h1 id="a-title">Aydin Mohseni</h1>
  <p class="lede">I&rsquo;m a mathematical philosopher, metascientist, and AI safety researcher. I&rsquo;m an Assistant Professor of Philosophy at <a href="https://www.cmu.edu/dietrich/philosophy/">Carnegie Mellon University</a>, and a core member of its <a href="https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~coresafeai/">Center for Conceptual Research on Safe AI</a> and <a href="https://www.cmu.edu/dietrich/social-dynamics/">Institute for Complex Social Dynamics</a>.</p>
